      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im kinda worried. lately i've been having these weird moments where i just get super confused out of nowhere. like i'll be in the middle of a sentence and i just cant find basic words or i dont know where i am for a few mins. it's been happening a few times this week. do u think its just like bad brain fog from stress or maybe i just need more sleep? feels like i'm just burnt out.",
